{
  "title": "DocumentVersionError",
  "description": "Thrown when a document's `$version` cannot be read. `reason` is `'newer'` for a document written by a newer application (never read best-effort, because re-saving it would lose data), `'discontinued'` for a version below `minVersion`, and `'invalid'` for a missing or malformed `$version`.",
